---
kind: env
name: uat
collections:
- collection: demo
  baseUrl: http://q.demo.test
---

# uat

Assigned to the `demo` collection — it is offered in this collection's environment picker
and nowhere else. Selecting it repoints every relative request line under `demo/` at
`q.demo.test`; the workspace-wide environments keep working alongside it.

The base URL lives on the assignment rather than on the environment because it is only
true of `demo`. Assign this same environment to a second collection and it gets its own
`baseUrl` there.
